Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:06.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His father can talk every point? Are you stupid?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他父亲每一分都能说话？你傻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:13.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His father can talk every point, his father can talk every point!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他父亲每一分都能说话 每一分！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.02,TL,,0,0,0,,对着主裁大吼的这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.70,TL,,0,0,0,,就是梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:19.96,TL,,0,0,0,,撒硬币 踢摄像机 砸球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.78,TL,,0,0,0,,他的罚单能列一长串
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:22.58,TL,,0,0,0,,可也是他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.23,TL,,0,0,0,,在颁奖台上让全场笑出了声
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:28.14,TL,,0,0,0,,他是反派 还是只是太真实？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:31.67,TL,,0,0,0,,故事要从{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年的温网说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:36.16,TL,,0,0,0,,那年他{\fs78}21{\fs68}岁 {\fs78}5{\fs68}盘输给了贝梅尔曼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:38.19,TL,,0,0,0,,握手之后 他掏出几枚硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.55,TL,,0,0,0,,朝主裁的椅子扔了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:45.75,TL,,0,0,0,,这场他一共被罚了{\fs78}14500{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:49.19,TL,,0,0,0,,事后他说 一时上头 我做了件坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:51.68,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后的美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:53.61,TL,,0,0,0,,第一周他对着看台竖中指
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:55.04,TL,,0,0,0,,被嘘了好几场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.11,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛他从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.11,0:00:59.02,TL,,0,0,0,,最后还是输给了纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:00.55,TL,,0,0,0,,被嘘了两个星期的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.55,0:01:02.95,TL,,0,0,0,,在颁奖台上拿起了话筒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I want to talk about you guys.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想说说你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:12.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I know, earlier in the tournament I said something kind of in a bad way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我知道 之前我说话不太好听
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:14.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now I'm saying it in a good way:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在我换个好听的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:17.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because of your energy, guys, I was here in the final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是你们的能量把我送进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:20.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, as I said, it's electric.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我说过 这里的气氛太热烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:25.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You were booing me for a reason, I never said that it was not,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你们嘘我是有原因的 我从没否认
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:28.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but you guys see that I can also change,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但你们也看到了 我也能改变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:30.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because I'm a human being, I can make mistakes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是人 我也会犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:33.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And again, thank you very much from the bottom of my heart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N再次衷心感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:35.10,TL,,0,0,0,,后来他拿了大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:37.87,TL,,0,0,0,,拿了大满贯 脾气一点没改
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:40.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年马德里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.31,0:01:42.61,TL,,0,0,0,,他在红土上已经连输{\fs78}6{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.77,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛打到一半 他边走边嘟囔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:47.39,TL,,0,0,0,,说根本不想在这种场地上打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:53.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, he's not looking happy, Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫看起来很不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't want to play here on this surface.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不想在这种场地上打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, pretty clear what he's thinking.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他心里怎么想 很清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.27,TL,,0,0,0,,结果他翻盘赢下了这场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.09,TL,,0,0,0,,止住了红土上的六连败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:05.67,TL,,0,0,0,,这也是他第一次在马德里赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}See what he's writing on the camera here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看他在镜头上写了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It might be something about clay.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好像跟红土有关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:16.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He loves the clay, of course he does.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他爱红土 当然爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:18.89,TL,,0,0,0,,同一年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 辛辛那提半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:20.62,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:21.52,TL,,0,0,0,,他追一个球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.11,TL,,0,0,0,,整个人撞上了场边的摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:29.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You okay, sir?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你没事吧 先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.27,TL,,0,0,0,,他让主裁把摄像机挪走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:33.10,TL,,0,0,0,,我的手差点撞断了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:36.11,TL,,0,0,0,,回场边时 他还踹了一脚镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:40.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Absolutely clattering into the camera there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他整个人撞上了摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:42.48,TL,,0,0,0,,领先一盘的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.77,TL,,0,0,0,,最后他输给了卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:48.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:51.38,TL,,0,0,0,,德约科维奇离年度全满贯只差一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.18,TL,,0,0,0,,全场都在等他创造历史
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.82,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫没给他机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘全是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:10.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-four, six-four, six-four.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.51,TL,,0,0,0,,他慢慢倒在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.74,TL,,0,0,0,,吐着舌头 像一条死鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.35,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他从足球游戏里学来的庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:19.86,TL,,0,0,0,,说是给一起打游戏的朋友看的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年澳网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:24.94,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:27.62,TL,,0,0,0,,他认定对方父亲在看台上一直指导
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.22,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁却不管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:32.41,TL,,0,0,0,,于是有了开头那一幕 他还没吼完
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:37.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Will you answer my question? Can you answer my question, please?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你能回答我的问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:39.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can his father talk every point?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他父亲能每一分都说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my God, you are so bad, man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 你太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How can you be so bad in the semi-final?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N半决赛你怎么能这么差？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:50.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Look at me, I'm talking to you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看着我 我在跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:54.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}If you don't, you are a, how can I call it, small cat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不然你就是个 怎么说呢 小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.71,TL,,0,0,0,,他因此被罚了{\fs78}12000{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:58.80,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后说自己完全后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘过后 他还是进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.51,TL,,0,0,0,,这几年 冠军越来越难拿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他的情绪也越来越藏不住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.01,0:04:10.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他又输给了德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:15.13,TL,,0,0,0,,颁奖台上 他先开了个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:23.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First of all, I want to ask Novak, what are you still doing here? Come on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N先问问诺瓦克 你怎么还在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:30.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No jokes apart. What is it, our third final?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不开玩笑 这是第三次决赛了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maybe not the last. Hope so.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也许不是最后一次 希望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:36.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Because you're probably going to be in many more.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你大概还会进很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:41.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't know when are you planning to slow down a little bit,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不知道你打算什么时候慢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:44.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but congrats to you and your team.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恭喜你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:47.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, 24. I feel like I have not a bad career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}24{\fs68}个啊 我觉得我生涯还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:50.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I have 20 titles. You have 24 Grand Slams. Wow.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有{\fs78}20{\fs68}个冠军 你有{\fs78}24{\fs68}个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:53.81,TL,,0,0,0,,接着 他讲起了一件巧事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.37,TL,,0,0,0,,那天又是他的结婚纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:02.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}On the second note, I was here two years ago when I won,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有一件事 两年前我在这里夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:09.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I was like, what a great anniversary gift for my wife.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想 这份纪念日礼物真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:15.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And yeah, it's funny, because dates usually change,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有意思的是 日期一般会变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:20.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but today, Sunday, again is the anniversary,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可今天这个星期天 又是纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I thought, come on, do it one more time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就想 来吧 再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But, yeah, it didn't happen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可惜 没成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.90,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是世界第{\fs78}418{\fs68}位的萨姆雷吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.33,TL,,0,0,0,,这场他打得很挣扎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:34.51,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘丢掉 大比分{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:41.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, through the soft, forgiving lens of nostalgia,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N隔着怀旧那层柔光滤镜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:46.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and you'll excuse the pun of lens,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N原谅我拿镜头打比方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}you'll forgive him, because he's going to be paying for that camera,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你会原谅他 反正摄像机他得赔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:54.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he'll be happy to put his hand in his pocket if he wins this match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N只要赢下这场 他掏钱也乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.34,TL,,0,0,0,,这场他最后{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘赢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.55,TL,,0,0,0,,可这一届澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:06:00.49,TL,,0,0,0,,砸摄像机加上第二轮的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:03.16,TL,,0,0,0,,他一共被罚了{\fs78}76000{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年美网首轮 他两盘落后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:10.07,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 邦齐拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.08,TL,,0,0,0,,一发失误之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.96,TL,,0,0,0,,一个摄影记者走进了场地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.20,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁判让邦齐重发一发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.59,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫冲到主裁椅下理论
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:21.13,TL,,0,0,0,,又转身对着看台挥手 让全场喊起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:27.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He wants to go home, guys. He doesn't like to be here,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他想回家 他不想待在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:29.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he gets paid by the match, not by the hour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是按场拿钱 不是按小时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.40,TL,,0,0,0,,嘘声停不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:33.28,TL,,0,0,0,,看台上一遍遍喊着 二发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.97,TL,,0,0,0,,他还朝主裁飞吻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.18,TL,,0,0,0,,邦齐在底线足足等了六分多钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.26,TL,,0,0,0,,这一发才终于发出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match point saved.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点被救下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:07.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Bonzi has never been so close to winning a match,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N邦齐离胜利从没这么近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}yet so far away as he is right now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也从没这么远
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:12.83,TL,,0,0,0,,他把比赛追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 第四盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.82,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘还是输给了邦齐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.87,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后他把球拍砸烂在椅子上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.74,TL,,0,0,0,,被罚{\fs78}42500{\fs68}美元 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:22.21,TL,,0,0,0,,我只是表达了我的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:25.02,TL,,0,0,0,,今年蒙特卡洛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.40,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}输给贝雷蒂尼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.12,TL,,0,0,0,,只打了{\fs78}49{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.97,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他职业生涯第一次吃到双蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:40.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is becoming a real headache now for Medvedev, and goodness me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫真的头疼了 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,砸完球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.43,TL,,0,0,0,,他把它扔进了场边的垃圾桶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.47,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月的温斯顿-塞勒姆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:48.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他是头号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.17,TL,,0,0,0,,却直落两盘输给了外卡达姆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.71,TL,,0,0,0,,这是达姆第一次赢下世界前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:57.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场输了{\fs78}4{\fs68}场 他开始认真考虑转行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:02.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maybe I should start a career in pickleball,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也许我该改行打匹克球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}not too late,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在还不晚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.45,0:08:07.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with Jack Sock, in doubles.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N和索克搭档打双打
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:13.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Every sport on this planet is better, man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这星球上哪项运动都更好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Even curling right now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在连冰壶都更好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.10,TL,,0,0,0,,扔硬币的是他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:20.11,TL,,0,0,0,,在颁奖台上让全场鼓掌的也是他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:22.38,TL,,0,0,0,,你更喜欢哪一个梅总？
